{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Addendum: the comment above says the main-config load fires only on first mount. A write in the same worktree with the symlink present also emitted the warning; tracing that write path now, results in the next comment."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793532736904931001,"uuid":"5597e0a6-4489-4002-9fae-72cc94f36e47"}